              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"lh-work-grid\">\n  <article class=\"lh-work-card\" data-categories=\"ai branding\"><a href=\"/portfolio/\"><div class=\"lh-work-media\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/stride-beyond.jpg\" alt=\"Stride Beyond\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"lh-work-info\"><div class=\"lh-tag-row\"><span class=\"lh-tag\">AI Generated</span><span class=\"lh-tag\">Branding</span></div><h3 class=\"lh-work-title\">Stride Beyond</h3><p>AI-led identity exploration for a futuristic visual language.</p></div></a></article>\n  <article class=\"lh-work-card\" data-categories=\"branding\"><a href=\"/portfolio/\"><div class=\"lh-work-media\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/nexora.jpg\" alt=\"Nexora\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"lh-work-info\"><div class=\"lh-tag-row\"><span class=\"lh-tag\">Branding</span></div><h3 class=\"lh-work-title\">Nexora</h3><p>Brand system exploration with premium futuristic identity cues.</p></div></a></article>\n  <article class=\"lh-work-card\" data-categories=\"branding cgi\"><a href=\"/portfolio/\"><div class=\"lh-work-media\"><img src=\"/wp-content/uploads/bt-studio-beverage.jpg\" alt=\"BT Studio – CGI Beverage Demo\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"lh-work-info\"><div class=\"lh-tag-row\"><span class=\"lh-tag\">Branding</span><span class=\"lh-tag\">CGI</span></div><h3 class=\"lh-work-title\">BT Studio – CGI Beverage Demo</h3><p>Product-led CGI beverage demo with polished advertising finish.</p></div></a></article>\n</div>"
