                "html": "<div class=\"lh-service-grid\">\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">01</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">3D Product & CGI Visuals</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">Premium product compositions, pack shots and campaign-ready CGI scenes.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">02</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">AI Campaign Imagery</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">AI-assisted visual exploration, concept boards and stylized brand imagery.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">03</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">VFX & Post-production</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">Compositing, retouching, enhancement and cinematic finishing for moving or still assets.</p></div></article>\n<article class=\"lh-service-card\"><span class=\"lh-service-number\">04</span><div><h3 class=\"lh-service-title\">Visual Direction</h3><p class=\"lh-service-copy\">Campaign look development, key visual systems and production-ready visual storytelling.</p></div></article>\n</div>"
